/* [EN] The look of the example's tag lists: a gradient plate, a glass section card, wrapping tags 10 px apart. [CN] 示例 TagList 的外观：渐变背景板、玻璃分组卡片、间距 10 px 的换行标签。 */
page {
  min-height: 100%;
  background: linear-gradient(160deg, #dbe7ff 0%, #f3e1ff 50%, #ffe8d9 100%);
}
.cyl-badge-tags-page {
  padding: 16px;
}
.cyl-badge-tags-toggle {
  margin: 0;
}
.cyl-badge-tags-header {
  padding: 16px 16px 8px;
  font-size: 17px;
  font-weight: bold;
}
/* [EN] The negative margins take back the outer half of the tags' spacing. [CN] 负外边距抵消标签间距的外侧部分。 */
.cyl-badge-tags-card {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 9px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  border-radius: 20px;
  background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
}
.cyl-badge-tags-tag {
  margin: 5px;
}
@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  page {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #141b33 0%, #261a38 50%, #33211c 100%);
  }
  .cyl-badge-tags-header {
    color: #ffffff;
  }
  .cyl-badge-tags-card {
    background-color: rgba(30, 30, 34, 0.5);
  }
}
